  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "At constant temperature (isothermal process)\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nW_{D A}=n R T \\ln \\left(\\frac{P_1}{P_2}\\right)= & 2.303 \\times 2 \\mathrm{R} \\times 300 \\log \\left(\\frac{10^5}{2 \\times 10^5}\\right) \\\\\n& =2.303 \\times 600 \\mathrm{R} \\log \\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right) \\\\\n& =0.693 \\times 600 \\mathrm{R}=-414 \\mathrm{R} .\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
